        "near_end": true,
        "prefix_token_count": 652,
        "step_number": 6,
        "text": "Step 6: The area of triangle \\(ACD\\) is:\n\\[ \\text{Area of } \\triangle ACD = \\frac{1}{2} \\times AD \\times CD = \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\frac{64}{17} \\times \\frac{120}{17} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\frac{7680}{289} = \\frac{3840}{289} \\]"
      }
